<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jacques Zaninetta is a seasoned French politician who has spent decades in politics, known for his influence and dedication to public service. He later transitions to a life as a pensioner and becomes a respected priest in the town of Saint-Pierre."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lyon is a quaint town in France where Jacques Zaninetta lived during his political career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAINT-PIERRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Saint-Pierre is a sleepy town where Jacques Zaninetta becomes a priest and is respected by the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"French politics is the field in which Jacques Zaninetta worked for many years, characterized by complex webs and intense scrutiny."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PENSIONER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pensioner is the new role Jacques Zaninetta takes on after retiring from politics, involving a peaceful and comfortable lifestyle."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIEST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Priest is the role Jacques Zaninetta adopts after his political career, known for his gentle demeanor and deep wisdom."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MADAME DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Madame Dupont is the owner of the local patisserie in Saint-Pierre, known for her warmth and generosity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHURCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Church is the place where Father Jacques Zaninetta works and performs his duties as a priest."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOUP KITCHEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soup Kitchen is an evening event organized by Father Jacques Zaninetta to provide food and comfort to the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANCIENT CHURCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ancient Church is the place where Father Jacques Zaninetta is seen performing his duties and where he disappears into after the evening's events."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOWN SQUARE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Town Square is the gathering place in Saint-Pierre where the townsfolk congregate and where Father Jacques Zaninetta is seen interacting with the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOWNSPEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Townspeople are the residents of Saint-Pierre who show respect and admiration for Father Jacques Zaninetta."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MADAME DUPONT'S PATISSERIE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Madame Dupont's Patisserie is the local bakery where Madame Dupont prepares food for the evening's soup kitchen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INCENSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Incense is used in the Church and carries the scent that wafts out, symbolizing solace and comfort."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOFT CHANTING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOUND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soft Chanting is the sound that can be heard from the Church, providing a sense of solace and comfort."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BAGUETTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Baguette is a type of bread prepared by Madame Dupont and given to Father Jacques Zaninetta for the evening's soup kitchen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EVENING CROWD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Evening Crowd is the group of people gathered in the Town Square, including Father Jacques Zaninetta and the townsfolk."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RUMORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rumors are circulating about Father Jacques Zaninetta's past, suggesting he may have been a politician or a teacher."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MADAME DUPONT'S BAGUETTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Madame Dupont's Baguette is a specific item given to Father Jacques Zaninetta, symbolizing her support and respect."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL PATISSERIE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local Patisserie is the bakery owned by Madame Dupont, where she prepares food for the evening's soup kitchen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INCENSE SCENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SCENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Incense Scent is the faint smell that wafts out of the Church, symbolizing solace and comfort."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOFT CHANTING SOUND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"SOUND"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soft Chanting Sound is the sound that can be heard from the Church, providing a sense of solace and comfort."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EVENING'S SOUP KITCHEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Evening's Soup Kitchen is the event organized by Father Jacques Zaninetta to provide food and comfort to the community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FATHER JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0217</data>
      <data key="d1">"Father Jacques Zaninetta works and performs his duties as a priest in the Church, a place of solace and comfort for the community."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;" target="&quot;LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Jacques Zaninetta lived in Lyon during his political career, a place he left behind for a new life as a pensioner."</data>
      <data key="d5">"residence, political career"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;" target="&quot;SAINT-PIERRE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Jacques Zaninetta moved to Saint-Pierre after retiring, becoming a respected priest in the community."</data>
      <data key="d5">"retirement, new role"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;" target="&quot;FRENCH POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Jacques Zaninetta was a prominent figure in French politics, known for his influence and dedication to public service."</data>
      <data key="d5">"political influence, public service"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;" target="&quot;PENSIONER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Jacques Zaninetta transitioned from his political career to a life as a pensioner, seeking peace and comfort."</data>
      <data key="d5">"career change, peace"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;" target="&quot;PRIEST&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Jacques Zaninetta became a respected priest in Saint-Pierre, known for his gentle demeanor and deep wisdom."</data>
      <data key="d5">"religious devotion, community respect"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;" target="&quot;MADAME DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Madame Dupont provides Father Jacques Zaninetta with a baguette for the evening's soup kitchen, showing her support and respect."</data>
      <data key="d5">"support, provision"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CHURCH&quot;" target="&quot;FATHER JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Father Jacques Zaninetta works and performs his duties as a priest in the Church, a place of solace and comfort for the community."</data>
      <data key="d5">"place of worship, spiritual guidance"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;SOUP KITCHEN&quot;" target="&quot;FATHER JACQUES ZANINETTA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Father Jacques Zaninetta organizes the Soup Kitchen to provide food and comfort to the community, demonstrating his commitment to helping others."</data>
      <data key="d5">"community service, compassion"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0217</data>
    </edge>
  </graph>
</graphml>
